{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L5_003", "section": "Front matter", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 5, "pages": [5], "text": "根據上市規則,股東週年大會上所有決議案將以投票方式表決(惟若決議案與程序或行政事宜有 關,則主席可決定容許該決議案以舉手方式表決) 。投票結果將按照上市規則規定刊載於香港交易", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": null, "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/70"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/70", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 5, "bbox": [113.39, 404.73, 510.25, 425.87], "source_block_id": "#/texts/70", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [113.39, 404.73, 510.25, 425.87], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 54, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
