{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L5_005", "section": "Front matter", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 5, "pages": [5], "text": "凡有權出席股東週年大會及在會上投票的本公司股東( 「 股東 」 ) ,均可委派一名或多名代表作為其 代表代其出席及在以投票方式表決時代其投票。受委代表毋須為股東。若委派一名以上代表,相關 代表委任表格上必須註明每一名受委代表所代表的股份數目。親自出席或委派代表出席的每位股東 有權對其持有的每一股股份投一票。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": null, "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/72"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/72", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 5, "bbox": [85.04, 460.25, 510.31, 509.89], "source_block_id": "#/texts/72", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [85.04, 460.25, 510.31, 509.89], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 56, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
{"type": "paragraph", "paragraph_id": "L5_006", "section": "Front matter", "section_id": "SEC001", "page": 5, "pages": [5], "text": "代表委任表格及已簽署的授權書或其他授權文件(如有)或該等授權書或授權文件的經公證人核證 副本,須不遲於大會或其續會(視情況而定)指定舉行時間 48 小時之前(即不遲於 2026 年 6 月 24 日 (星期三) 上午 10 時正 (香港時間) ) 送達本公司的香港證券登記分處卓佳證券登記有限公司,地址為 香港夏愨道 16 號遠東金融中心 17 樓,方為有效。填妥及交回代表委任表格後,股東仍可親身出席 股東週年大會並於會上投票;在此情況下,上述代表委任表格將被視為撤銷論。", "block_type": "list", "paragraph_role": "body", "body_only": true, "local_heading": null, "source_block_ids": ["#/texts/73"], "source_block_id": "#/texts/73", "source_parsers": ["docling"], "source_parser": "docling", "source_tools": ["docling"], "bboxes": [{"page": 5, "bbox": [85.04, 530.75, 510.27, 593.9], "source_block_id": "#/texts/73", "source_parser": "docling"}], "bbox": [85.04, 530.75, 510.27, 593.9], "bbox_coordinate_system": "pdf_points_top_left", "cross_page": false, "language": "zh", "document_order": 57, "merge_method": "docling_layout_tracks_v4"}
